                    "description": "The Lion King follows the adventures of a young lion named Simba, who is cast out of his pride by his cruel uncle, Scar, who plans to usurp his throne. With the help of some charismatic friends named Pumba and Timon, Simba finds the courage to return to Pride Rock and reclaim his throne.    The soundtrack for the film features iconic original songs written by the legendary Elton John and Tim Rice, with transformative score composed by Hans Zimmer. The savannah of the Pride Lands comes to life in songs like “Circle of Life” and “Hakuna Matata,” among other favorites from the soundtrack for the whole family.",
